Source: libpff
Priority: optional
Section: libs
Maintainer: openSUSE <opensuse@opensuse.xz>
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12)

Package: libpff1
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Library and tools to access Microsoft PFF/OFF/PST/OST/PAB files
 libpff is a library to access the Personal Folder File (PFF) and the
 Offline Folder File (OFF) format. These are used in several file
 Types: PAB (Personal Address Book), PST (Personal Storage Table) and
 OST (Offline Storage Table).
 
Package: libpff-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: libpff1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for libpff
 libpff is a library to access the Personal Folder File (PFF) and the
 Offline Folder File (OFF) format. These are used in several file
 Types: PAB (Personal Address Book), PST (Personal Storage Table) and
 OST (Offline Storage Table).
 .
 This subpackage contains libraries and header files for developing
 applications that want to make use of libpff.

Package: libpff-tools
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: libpff1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Tools to access Microsoft PST and OST files
 Tools to access the Personal Folder File (PFF) and the Offline Folder
 File (OFF) format. These are used in several file types: PAB
 (Personal Address Book), PST (Personal Storage Table) and OST
 (Offline Storage Table).
